      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If this feature request is focus on being anti harassment I do not believe it'll work. Bad actors will see that a person is not in the camera preview and now have a target to harass. \n\nI'm not sure if you're a stand-alone quest user, or a PC user, but on PC I can have OBS capture my view. So anything I see can be recorded.\n\nMaybe there is room for a good option, I just think it needs some thought given to how users will react.\n\nMaybe it's just the camera noise that is actually the harassment...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
