  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-06-19T08:07:46.130Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Would it be possible to have and option to hide avatar (completely) from pictures taken by other users? Optimally, this feature could also have selection to allow pictures taken by friends.\n\nI know there's a system to report harassing behavior already, but this could free up resources in the team handling the complaints.",
